+  Scenario: Existing todo elements persist when marking all as completed
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    When I save all todo element references
+    And I click the "Mark all as complete" toggle
+    Then each saved element should have class "completed"
+    And each saved element should be attached to the document
+
+  Scenario: Clearing the completed state preserves remaining elements
+    Given todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog" exist
+    And "Buy milk" is marked as completed
+    When I save the element reference for "Walk dog"
+    And I click "Clear completed"
+    Then "Walk dog" should appear in the todo list
+    And the saved element for "Walk dog" should be attached to the document
+
+  Scenario: Existing todo elements persist when creating a new todo
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When I save the element reference for "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo "Walk dog"
+    Then the saved element for "Buy milk" should be attached to the document
+
   @contract
   Scenario: The todo item conforms to the todo-item schema
     Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
